sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-17file-turing-wavelength-s0> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-17file-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-17file-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Eldredgeops rana_17file Turing wavelength at 342 nm (Tioughniogan, 384 Ma) — MorphoEval overall 76.5/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 1 implements Schnakenberg kinetics and the Turing critical wavenumber, with the length unit fixed so lambda_c = 342 nm. Numeric growth rates match analytic sigma(k) at Pearson r = 0.99997. One spot forms in the 1.15-wavelength cell. The raw activator radial profile correlates only 0.618 with the gallery-plate luminance, and this pass does not run the diffusion sweep or the equal-diffusion ablation. Overall 76.5/100 (faithfulness 73.0, reproducibility 84.8); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 84, Morphological realism / specimen match 72, Parameter expressivity 58, Morphometric validation 70, Source and data traceability 88, Code-to-model traceability 82, Reproducibility package 84. Output judged: docs/media/eldredgeops_rana_17file_turing_wavelength_s0_growth.gif: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-17file-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc, image/gif, 2508730 B, 640×480 px, 12 frames, artifact_sha256 c3fa3011c8b3efc6b27b117a11defa5e6b5e0d5d9017e9da3a1723f9bcaca48b (sha256 c3fa3011c8b3efc6b27b117a11defa5e6b5e0d5d9017e9da3a1723f9bcaca48b), spec_fingerprint 85220eeb3c45cab3b7d0f79029a67be0c2bd7ed30f186a58a8339bf5949289d0. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 85220eeb3c45cab3b7d0f79029a67be0c2bd7ed30f186a58a8339bf5949289d0; artifact_sha256: c3fa3011c8b3efc6b27b117a11defa5e6b5e0d5d9017e9da3a1723f9bcaca48b. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952 selects a finite critical wavenumber when the two morphogens diffuse at different rates. | Eldredge 1972 documents a step from 18 to 17 dorsoventral lens files between the Cazenovian and Tioughniogan horizons.; reconstructed_in_script: Schnakenberg parameters rho_a=0.082, rho_b=0.918, D_u=0.060, D_v=1.200 and a periodic cell of side 1.15 lambda_c. | Physical wavelength 342 nm is the length-unit definition at this parameter point, not a measurement from a Devonian thin section.; transfer_boundary: The gallery plate is a radial ocellus luminance field with a labeled 100 micrometre bar. Radial shape is compared in dimensionless radius.; does_not_claim: That 342 nm was measured on an Eldredgeops lens, or that the gallery JPEG is a 342 nm micrograph. | That the pass-1 raw activator profile is a fitted specimen match.." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: {'id': 'R1', 'item': 'Execute the D_v sweep and record that lambda_c changes monotonically.'}",
            "remediation needed: {'id': 'R2', 'item': 'Add the equal-diffusion ablation and require sigma_max < 0 with a decayed field.'}",
            "remediation needed: {'id': 'R3', 'item': 'Fit a transmitted-light readout of (u, v) to the specimen radial luminance and report Pearson r, RMSE, and KS, with r > 0.98.'}",
            "remediation needed: {'id': 'R4', 'item': 'Segment the specimen and the GIF last frame (Otsu, bright-core fraction, structure-tensor coherency) and keep value distinct from the reference.'}",
            "remediation needed: {'id': 'R5', 'item': 'Compare the 18-file predecessor cell at the same 342 nm wavelength (pitch ratio 17/18) instead of only stating the file counts.'}" ;
        pk:hasScore "0.765"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 (builder-assessor, pass 1; remediation required)" ;
        dct:identifier "grok-4.7" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> .
}

